abbas aajao zainab akeli hai<br>
mehshar ghamon ka hai zehra ki jayee hai<br>
<br>
1. wo jalte khaime jalti khanatein<br>
wo sehmey bache pur dard raatein<br>
tum ko pukare behna tumhari<br>
aao chale aao - zainab akeli hai<br>
<br>
2. roti hai dekho bekas sakina<br>
tum ko pukare hai wo yatima<br>
pani ko tarse teri bhatiji<br>
pani pila jao - zainab akeli hai<br>
<br>
3. aandhi chali hai zulm- o -jafa ki<br>
main shaam ke bazaro se guzri<br>
chini sitam ne chadar hamari<br>
chadar udha jao - zainab akeli hai<br>
<br>
4. wo qaid khana wo ghup andhera<br>
bachi ne dekha na phir savera<br>
bano bhi roti tum ko pukaree<br>
zindan se chudwa'o zainab akeli hai<br>
<br>
5. eza uthaya hai ranj sehkar<br>
aankhon mein ansu hai khak sarpar<br>
zainab ye dukhiya chehlum ko aayee<br>
ab to chale aao - zainab akeli hai<br>
<br>
6. sugra jo puche asghar kahan hai<br>
qasim kahan hai akbar kahan hai<br>
kya us say boloon aye mere bhayee<br>
aakar batajao zainab akeli hai<br>
<br>
7. dil hashmi ka nauha kuna hai<br>
lab par raza ke aaho fughaan hai<br>
sunkar ye nauha har aankh royee<br>
abbas ajao - zainab akeli hai
